OL,3,GNEWSACycle path approved despite police
OL,4,Aobjections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new footpath and cycleway is to be
OL,7,Fbuilt, despite objections from police
OL,8,Fand residents.
OL,10,FStockton Council has approved the route
OL,11,Fnear Clarendon Road connecting Milbank
OL,12,FLane and the main entrance of St
OL,13,FPatrick's Catholic College in Thornaby.
OL,15,FCleveland Police said it did not
OL,16,Fsupport the proposal in November 2025
OL,17,Fdue to residents' concerns over
OL,18,Fmotorbike nuisance.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
