OL,3,GNEWSACycle path approved despite police
OL,4,Aobjections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's planning services manager
OL,7,FSimon Grundy said: "Whilst the comments
OL,8,Fand lack of support from Cleveland
OL,9,FPolice are acknowledged, the proposed
OL,10,Fmitigation measures would help to
OL,11,Freduce opportunities for anti-social
OL,12,Fbehaviour."
